WEBVTT

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.976
Na hakuna miujiza katika ubunifu
wa mawazo mapya --

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.335
ni kufanya baadhi ya mambo rahisi sana.

00:02:33.359 --> 00:02:34.976
Na ninatoa ushahidi mwingi.

00:02:35.291 --> 00:02:36.405
Stahimili!

00:02:36.799 --> 00:02:37.800
Joe Kraus anasema,

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:40.418
"Ustahimilifu ni sababu namba
moja ya mafanikio yetu. "

00:02:40.832 --> 00:02:44.374
Unahitaji kustahimili unapofeli. Unahitaji kustahimili misukosuko!

00:02:44.398 --> 00:02:47.913
Ambayo ni "Kukosolewa,
Kukataliwa, Watu ovyo na Presha."

00:02:47.937 --> 00:02:50.703
(Vicheko)

00:02:50.727 --> 00:02:54.446
Hivyo, jibu kwa swali hili ni rahisi:

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:56.595
Lipa dola 4,000 na uje kwenye TED.

00:02:56.619 --> 00:02:57.812
(Vicheko)

00:02:57.836 --> 00:03:00.574
Au ukishindwa hilo, fanya
mambo haya nane - na niamini,